OL,3,GNEWSARemembrance Sunday being marked
OL,4,Aacross Northern Ireland
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvents and services are taking place in
OL,7,Fcities, towns and villages across
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland to mark Remembrance
OL,9,FSunday.
OL,11,FBelfast's ceremony began with a
OL,12,Ftwo-minute silence at 11:00 GMT.
OL,14,FRemembrance Sunday is observed on the
OL,15,Fsecond Sunday of November.
