OL,3,GNEWSARemembrance Sunday being marked
OL,4,Aacross Northern Ireland
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirst Minister Michelle O'Neill and
OL,7,FDeputy First Minister Emma
OL,8,FLittle-Pengelly will not be in
OL,9,Fattendance in their official capacities
OL,10,Fat remembrance events on Sunday
OL,11,Ffollowing the fall out of the Drumcree
OL,12,Fparading dispute.
